    "Name": "Flawless FLW-5G",
    "Details": "Early testing of the Flawless proved that the 'Mech was very vulnerable to infantry and light 'Mech attacks due to its slow charging Ion Cannon. The FLW-5G tries to address this by adding six AP Gauss Rifles and changing to a 400 XL core to slightly improve the mobility. Three Light AC/10 provide some sustained firepower for longer fights.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.32</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_flawless"
  },
